{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Ugga","html":"<article id='thag1.80'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.80 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.80 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Aṭṭhamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eight </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Uggattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ugga </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yaṁ mayā pakataṁ kammaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Any deeds I have done, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>appaṁ vā yadi vā bahuṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>a little or a lot, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sabbametaṁ parikkhīṇaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>are all completely exhausted: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>now there’ll be no more future lives. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Uggo thero … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>vaggo aṭṭhamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vacchapālo ca yo thero, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ātumo māṇavo isi; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Suyāmano susārado, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>thero yo ca piyañjaho; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ārohaputto meṇḍasiro, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>rakkhito uggasavhayoti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
